1
00:00:00,738 --> 00:00:04,038
(Leonard:)Afraid so, Skippy.

2
00:00:04,042 --> 00:00:06,772
(Sheldon:)I told you we shouldn't
go shopping at night.

3
00:00:12,427 --> 00:00:14,457
(Leonard:)All right, let's
all just calm down.

4
00:00:14,463 --> 00:00:16,163
(Leonard:)Nobody wants to
report anybody.

5
00:00:16,164 --> 00:00:17,534
(Man:)No, I don't like this.
I'm out.

6
00:00:17,532 --> 00:00:19,302
(Leonard:)No, no, no. Wait, don't go.

7
00:00:19,301 --> 00:00:20,571
(Leonard:)Just let me explain.

8
00:00:20,569 --> 00:00:22,599
(Leonard:)We're physicists,
and we're trying to prove

9
00:00:22,604 --> 00:00:25,334
(Leonard:)a hypothesis that we've been
working on for over a year.

10
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:28,710
(Man:)Really? What's the hypothesis?

11
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:30,640
(Sheldon:)Space-time can be interpreted as

12
00:00:30,645 --> 00:00:33,115
(Sheldon:)the surface of
an n-dimensional superfluid.

13
00:00:33,115 --> 00:00:34,785
(Man:)Hmm. Could be, could be.

14
00:00:34,783 --> 00:00:36,553
(Man:)Go on.

15
00:00:38,353 --> 00:00:40,923
(Leonard:)Okay, but now there's this
Swedish team that read our paper

16
00:00:40,922 --> 00:00:43,422
(Leonard:)and they're trying to beat us
to our own discovery.

17
00:00:44,359 --> 00:00:45,659
(Leonard:)We really need this helium.

18
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,960
(Sheldon:)And I'm sorry
I lied about

19
00:00:46,962 --> 00:00:49,362
(Sheldon:)being a wedding planner
who can't find love.

20
00:00:49,364 --> 00:00:52,394
(Sheldon:)Although I am currently
single, if you know anybody.

21
00:00:53,502 --> 00:00:55,332
(Leonard:)Here's the money.
Can we do this?

22
00:00:55,337 --> 00:00:59,027
(Stuart:)Okay.

